  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_01",
      "hash64": "6A5BBCE1902FB4E5",
      "text": "Yo, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_02",
      "hash64": "6A5BB9E1902FAFCC",
      "text": "Pour les combats officiels de la Ligue Myrtille,\\nc’est aussi ici qu’il faut s’inscrire.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_01",
      "hash64": "B94DB1F7E154384B",
      "text": "Vous êtes [VAR 0x0100(0000)], c’est bien cela ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_02",
      "hash64": "B94DB2F7E15439FE",
      "text": "Veuillez patienter pendant que je termine\\nles préparatifs de votre duel contre le Maître.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_03",
      "hash64": "6A5BBAE1902FB17F",
      "text": "Hé, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]...\\nTu t’entendais bien avec Kassis avant, non ?[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_select_01",
      "hash64": "3D7AE2DF3C6AE218",
      "text": "Oui !",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_select_02",
      "hash64": "3D7AE5DF3C6AE731",
      "text": "Plus ou moins.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_04",
      "hash64": "6A5BB7E1902FAC66",
      "text": "Je vois...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_05",
      "hash64": "6A5BB8E1902FAE19",
      "text": "Tu peux dire les choses clairement, hein.\\nMême entre amis, parfois ça clashe.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_06",
      "hash64": "6A5BB5E1902FA900",
      "text": "Perso, j’en peux plus, de son attitude.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_07",
      "hash64": "6A5BB6E1902FAAB3",
      "text": "OK, l’ancien Kassis, c’était un froussard avec\\nzéro confiance en lui...\\c\\nOK, il se planquait toujours derrière sa frangine,\\net il arrivait pas à articuler deux mots d’affilée...[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 179,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_08",
      "hash64": "6A5BC3E1902FC0CA",
      "text": "Mais, au moins, il avait un amour sincère pour\\nles combats ! On sentait qu’il se faisait plaiz ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_09",
      "hash64": "6A5BC4E1902FC27D",
      "text": "Et puis, d’un coup, il a changé.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_10",
      "hash64": "6A5F41E19032CCBB",
      "text": "C’est devenu un tyran. Il fait du mal à tout\\nle monde. Et franchement, à lui-même aussi.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_11",
      "hash64": "6A5F40E19032CB08",
      "text": "Faut vraiment que quelqu’un lui remette\\nles idées en place.[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_12",
      "hash64": "6A5F43E19032D021",
      "text": "C’est pas faute d’avoir essayé, mais j’ai perdu\\nen niveau, à force de me la couler douce...\\r\\nDonc, tout repose sur toi. Pas de pression, hein ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_03",
      "hash64": "B94DB3F7E1543BB1",
      "text": "Navrée pour l’attente.\\nLes préparatifs sont maintenant terminés.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_04",
      "hash64": "B94DB4F7E1543D64",
      "text": "Êtes-vous prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e à affronter Kassis,\\nle Maître de la Ligue Myrtille ?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_05",
      "hash64": "B94DB5F7E1543F17",
      "text": "Revenez dès que vous êtes prêt[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_06",
      "hash64": "B94DB6F7E15440CA",
      "text": "Entendu ! Veuillez prendre place,\\nvotre duel final va bientôt commencer.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_13",
      "hash64": "6A5F42E19032CE6E",
      "text": "C’est le moment...\\nJe compte sur toi, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_14",
      "hash64": "6A5F45E19032D387",
      "text": "On est avec toi, moi et tout le Conseil 4 ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_system_01",
      "hash64": "D77E99BA121E009B",
      "text": "Ding dong ♪\\nDing dong ♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_announce_01",
      "hash64": "671B74F0D8D8F0E1",
      "text": "Votre attention, ceci est un message\\nde la Ligue Myrtille...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_announce_02",
      "hash64": "671B71F0D8D8EBC8",
      "text": "Un duel contre le Maître est sur le point\\nde commencer.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_announce_03",
      "hash64": "671B72F0D8D8ED7B",
      "text": "Il aura lieu sur le terrain de combat, à l’entrée\\nde l’institut.\\c\\nToutes les personnes souhaitant y assister sont\\ninvitées à s’y rassembler.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_system_02",
      "hash64": "D77E9ABA121E024E",
      "text": "Ding dong ♪\\nDing dong ♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_dragonbb_15",
      "hash64": "6A5F44E19032D1D4",
      "text": "Le futur du Club de la Ligue et de Kassis est\\nentre tes mains, cousin[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e ![VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "004A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc02_0180_reception_npc",
      "hash64": "828CA632ED24C72F",
      "text": "Félicitations pour votre nouveau titre\\nde Maître[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0300)]sse de la Ligue Myrtille !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
